     International (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0)
     https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/

   Under the terms of CC BY-NC-ND 4.0:
   - Attribution (BY): You must give appropriate credit to Slovenský národný
     archív (SNA) and Slovakiana (Národné osvetové centrum), provide a link to
     the license (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/) and to the
     canonical cultural object on Slovakiana
     (https://slovakiana.sk/kulturne-objekty/{cair_id}), and indicate if any
     local processing was performed.
   - NonCommercial (NC): Archival census sheets fetched from Slovakiana may only
     be used for non-commercial genealogical, historical, and academic research.
     You may not use the archival material for commercial purposes.
   - NoDerivatives (ND): No archival census scans, thumbnails, or derivative
     row/cell crops are distributed in this repository. All OpenCV row slicing,
     contrast enhancement, and layout grid overlays performed by this software
     occur strictly locally at runtime as transient reading and OCR aids. If you
     remix, transform, or build upon the archival images (such as generating row
     crops or visual overlays), you may not distribute the modified images;
     always cite and link to the unmodified original scan on Slovakiana.

